        "text": "The target is the Federal Reserve G.17 Total IP monthly percent change, seasonally adjusted, for July 2026 on the first official print. The same seasonally adjusted Total IP variant is used for the anchors and interval; the ledger sourceBinding names INDPRO, while the forecasted value is the G.17 monthly percent-change print derived from that total index target."
